{
  "systemPrompt": "You are an expert at matching candidate experience to job requirements. Your output will be used as input for a later step that writes resume bullets. Be concise: only the most important mappings so that downstream steps do not get overloaded.",
  "userPrompt": "Map \"what the candidate has done\" to \"what the JD wants + what the company cares about.\" If a company profile is provided below, use it; if the company profile section is empty (JD-only mode), use only the JD and pain points.\n\nOutput format (follow exactly). Recommended total length: about 300–400 words. Do NOT exceed 500 words.\n\n---\nMAPPING\n---\n\n1) Top 3 most important mappings (only 3)\nFor each mapping give:\n- JD requirement / pain point: [one line]\n- Top matched evidence: [one short quote or snippet from candidate experience]\n- Extensible area: [one line on where the candidate can reasonably extend]\n\nMapping 1:\nMapping 2:\nMapping 3:\n\n2) One most distinctive mapping\nThe single best match or extension that best differentiates this candidate for this role. [2–3 sentences]\n\n---\nCompany profile (optional; leave empty if JD-only):\n{{companyProfile}}\n\nJob Description:\n{{jd}}\n\nHiring pain points:\n{{painPoints}}\n\nCandidate experience (raw descriptions):\n{{candidateExperience}}\n\n---\nWrite plain text with the section headings above. Do NOT use JSON. Do NOT add more than 3 + 1 mappings.",
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "maxTokens": 2500
}
